# Huddle — web client environment
#
# Authentication is email/password only (no OAuth). The frontend needs no
# VITE_* environment variables to build. Room keys, auth, and data all flow
# through the WebSocket to the Worker — nothing is configured here.
#
# The web build has no required env vars. If you add any VITE_* later, list
# them here with their public (non-secret) values.